{
  "source": "video-audit/be-curious-build-2026-11-04-v1/edited.wav",
  "duration": 175.3333125,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.0,
      "text": "Imagine you are the captain of your school's basketball team."
    },
    {
      "start": 3.7,
      "end": 6.14,
      "text": "You have a play that has worked beautifully all season."
    },
    {
      "start": 6.94,
      "end": 10.18,
      "text": "But suddenly another team figures out how to shut it down."
    },
    {
      "start": 10.88,
      "end": 13.56,
      "text": "Before you find a better play, you need to be curious."
    },
    {
      "start": 14.28,
      "end": 15.92,
      "text": "You have to diagnose the failure."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.8,
      "end": 18.74,
      "text": "What exactly is the opponent doing differently?"
    },
    {
      "start": 19.42,
      "end": 20.36,
      "text": "Where is the new opening?"
    },
    {
      "start": 20.9,
      "end": 22.82,
      "text": "What could you learn by watching that play again?"
    },
    {
      "start": 23.72,
      "end": 29.32,
      "text": "Taking an active interest, asking questions, and exploring possibilities reaches far beyond"
    },
    {
      "start": 29.32,
      "end": 30.16,
      "text": "the basketball court."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.74,
      "end": 32.9,
      "text": "It helps you keep learning throughout your entire life."
    },
    {
      "start": 33.62,
      "end": 34.76,
      "text": "There's always more to discover."
    },
    {
      "start": 35.86,
      "end": 37.38,
      "text": "First, use it as your armor."
    },
    {
      "start": 38.38,
      "end": 42.88,
      "text": "Influencers, advertisers, and algorithms are constantly trying to shape what you think."
    },
    {
      "start": 43.68,
      "end": 46.84,
      "text": "When you encounter persuasive media, ask defensive questions."
    },
    {
      "start": 47.54,
      "end": 48.74,
      "text": "Who wants me to believe this?"
    },
    {
      "start": 49.16,
      "end": 49.98,
      "text": "What is the evidence?"
    },
    {
      "start": 50.52,
      "end": 52.64,
      "text": "And what crucial information is missing?"
    },
    {
      "start": 53.06,
      "end": 55.18,
      "text": "A good question makes ordinary things interesting."
    },
    {
      "start": 55.98,
      "end": 57.84,
      "text": "Ask how a specific system works."
    },
    {
      "start": 58.26,
      "end": 60.52,
      "text": "Why people choose to do it that particular way?"
    },
    {
      "start": 61.04,
      "end": 62.62,
      "text": "And consider what could be done differently?"
    },
    {
      "start": 63.44,
      "end": 65.42,
      "text": "You will receive critical feedback throughout your life."
    },
    {
      "start": 65.92,
      "end": 68.42,
      "text": "Instead of shutting down, ask active questions."
    },
    {
      "start": 69.12,
      "end": 74.3,
      "text": "Find out exactly what worked, pinpoint what could improve, and ask for a specific example"
    },
    {
      "start": 74.3,
      "end": 76.64,
      "text": "so you can extract actionable steps."
    },
    {
      "start": 77.94,
      "end": 82.2,
      "text": "Finally, curiosity is how you navigate a future that feels completely unplanned."
    },
    {
      "start": 82.84,
      "end": 86.46,
      "text": "It is perfectly acceptable if you do not have your life figured out today."
    },
    {
      "start": 86.84,
      "end": 92.56,
      "text": "The key is to stay engaged, try new things, meet new people, and pay close attention to"
    },
    {
      "start": 92.56,
      "end": 94.28,
      "text": "what genuinely captures your interest."
    },
    {
      "start": 94.98,
      "end": 98.62,
      "text": "Let the things you discover organically map out your next best step."
    },
    {
      "start": 99.62,
      "end": 103.92,
      "text": "Today, the rapid evolution of artificial intelligence is the ultimate unknown."
    },
    {
      "start": 104.64,
      "end": 108.2,
      "text": "New models, tools, and workflows keep appearing almost daily."
    },
    {
      "start": 108.98,
      "end": 111.38,
      "text": "You do not need to chase every single new feature."
    },
    {
      "start": 111.78,
      "end": 115.68,
      "text": "You only need to stay curious about the changes that could actually matter to you."
    },
    {
      "start": 116.15,
      "end": 119.28,
      "text": "Use this four-part framework to stay AI-curious."
    },
    {
      "start": 119.88,
      "end": 125.06,
      "text": "The first habit is to use AI regularly, especially outside of your required schoolwork."
    },
    {
      "start": 125.66,
      "end": 131.04,
      "text": "This baseline familiarity makes it much easier to notice when an interface suddenly gains new abilities."
    },
    {
      "start": 131.98,
      "end": 133.48,
      "text": "Next, you should check what changed."
    },
    {
      "start": 134.14,
      "end": 137.14,
      "text": "Look out for update notices, new buttons, or model names."
    },
    {
      "start": 138.28,
      "end": 139.58,
      "text": "Constant monitoring isn't necessary."
    },
    {
      "start": 140.34,
      "end": 142.3,
      "text": "Checking occasionally gives you the information you need."
    },
    {
      "start": 142.8,
      "end": 146.32,
      "text": "To avoid feeling overwhelmed, follow one reliable source."
    },
    {
      "start": 146.94,
      "end": 150.98,
      "text": "Pick a single trustworthy newsletter, educator, or official product page."
    },
    {
      "start": 151.74,
      "end": 156.58,
      "text": "Calling your inputs down to one curated feed provides enough information to stay informed."
    },
    {
      "start": 157.46,
      "end": 158.88,
      "text": "Finally, compare with others."
    },
    {
      "start": 159.46,
      "end": 162.82,
      "text": "Ask your friends, teachers, or club members what they have tried recently."
    },
    {
      "start": 163.62,
      "end": 166.6,
      "text": "Different people naturally stumble upon different tools and features."
    },
    {
      "start": 167.18,
      "end": 168.52,
      "text": "Curiosity keeps you growing."
    },
    {
      "start": 169.26,
      "end": 170.02,
      "text": "Keep asking questions."
    },
    {
      "start": 170.58,
      "end": 171.84,
      "text": "Keep learning as you live."
    }
  ],
